Adding the Entry to the WMI Database

At this point, the attacker has configured the system to trigger when bob fails to log in and has
determined the command that should run when the trigger fires. Next, the attacker needs to
build the needed entries in the WMI database. One way this can be done is by uploading the file
persistence.mof from Listing 11-1 to the target.

