phpMyAdmin Feature Storage

The phpMyAdmin application can use the database server as a location to store data for
additional features, including bookmarks and history. This database, named phpmyadmin, is
enabled by default on Mint/Ubuntu systems and on XAMPP, but it is not included on CentOS,
OpenSuSE, or on Windows systems using IIS.
